WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.001 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Hey. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
Please welcome one of
my writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:06.006
for a special Super Bowl edition
of "Amber Says What."

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.308 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:09.175 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:12.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
Amber, Alexa predicts
that the Eagles will win

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:12.779 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
the Super Bowl.

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:15.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I heard that and was
like, "[Excitedly] What?!"

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
But you know Rob Gronkowski

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.553
heard that
and he was like, "[Dully] What?"

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:24.491
And, Seth, people were going
like, "Tom Brady's going back

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the Super Bowl,"
and I was like, "What?"

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.295 size:84% position:42%
And people were like,
"It's his eighth time."

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:30.597 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And I was like, "What?"

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:32.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
And people were like,
"He's 40."

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:35.535 line:92%
And I was like, "Whaaaat...

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.070 size:88% position:44% line:92%
face cream does he use?"

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.939 line:92%
This has been "Amber Says What."

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.108 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

